.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aegis/1519000-tc-aegis-theories?p=1519071#post1519071\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think Tiresias the Seer is genderfluid. Of course this doesn\u2019t rule out them being Max Mercer.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wasn't talking about him. Check out the Society of the Lion writeup in Preview 2.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4081-thomas-weinbrenner","name":"Thomas Weinbrenner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T02:28:23-07:00","id":1519085,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Thomas Weinbrenner</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aegis/1519000-tc-aegis-theories?p=1519026#post1519026\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And the &quot;Seer&quot; is <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> Maxwell Mercer, right after the Hammersmith Experiment.</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>We know that Max Mercer <i>was not</i> travelling inside jumpship on Hammersmith Experiment explosion. ( As Hammersmith was manor in 1920s London. ) He <i>could</i> be coming back on it from far future in jumpship, after few first jumps.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T03:52:55-07:00","id":1519094,"title":"","content":"I don't think he was inside the jump ship. Maybe the jump ship somehow collided with Mercer being flung through time and space.<br /> <br /> The description of the Seer makes me think that Maxwell is still inexperienced at the beginning. He isn't used to this.<br /> <br /> Also Divis Mal knew about novas (or something he thinks were novas) in this time period. When Maxwell returned from his first trip 6 months after the Hammersmith Experiment, it was Michael Donighal who took him in and cared for him, and probably learned about his travels through time. Since their relationship became more strained over the years, I am quite certain, that Aegis must have happened at the very beginning.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4081-thomas-weinbrenner","name":"Thomas Weinbrenner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T04:27:31-07:00","id":1519099,"title":"","content":"Well, the writtens we see in 1e about gods, sorcerers and heroes is more about expeculation than properly any form of true knowlege, so Mal is probably unaware of Aegis era of inspiration.<br /> <br /> Max probably is not the seer, even less probable a young Max, as we know where Max has been by the Secrets of Adventure! and Ian said Max never went back in time to eras prior Adventure! (as far as we know).<br /> <br /> The idea of Tartarus being another ship and the Sky Chariot being trying to help humans is interesting as I see, but I dont think it's solid. The Sky Chariot abrosia (and all the other ambrosia around the world) is doing terrible things too, not trying to help or cause damage people, just random effects. I think Tartarus is probably the drive/motor while the sky chariot is the living quarters. The Motor has the most amazing tech and the highest amount of amazing materials of every vehicle, while the living quarters have the daily use equipment (that is amazing too).<br /> <br /> Tiresias being genderfluid is in the description: &quot;lived live as man and woman&quot;. If not genderfluid, Tiressias is capable of switching physical sex (what makes genderfluid+).<br /> <br /> My theory is that the Ship was destroyed mid time travel and parts fall all over timeline, ambrosia being the Fuel (or the closest thing to fuel) while the crystals from the atlanteans are made from by the impact, not part of the original ship.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T04:48:29-07:00","id":1519101,"title":"","content":"I don't think ambrosia is fuel. I think ambrosia are nanobots. In the first weeks there was still some intellect guiding them (when there was liquid ambrosia crawling across the landscape like it was alive, and when it actively pursued some people), later when this intellect degraded they began to mindless change everyone who came in contact with them.<br /> <br /> As for &quot;Max went never back in time&quot;, well people change their opinions. I am old enough to remember how White Wolf were adamant that they would NEVER publish a book about Gehenna.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4081-thomas-weinbrenner","name":"Thomas Weinbrenner","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"19"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T07:34:24-07:00","id":1519109,"title":"","content":"I just read the part about the Seer in the Society of the Lion writeup and I agree that could be Max.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amethyst is my birthstone. She/they.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26996-amethyst","name":"Amethyst","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26996_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"873"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-07-29T09:19:21-07:00","id":1519114,"title":"","content":"I dont mean ambrosia is like gasoline, or super tech gasoline, but something that empowers the ship somehow, like a power source. It may be intelligent and willing to empower people that can be empowered, in my mind it gives the ship (and probably all kinds of super tech) the energy to work, and it happen to change people and animals too, giving them the energy to manifest powers they are not capable of developing without it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspire